@Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress = http://localhost:5299
@Keycloak_HostAddress = http://localhost:8080

### Get a bearer token (requires `pwsh ./init.ps1 -DevTestUser`, local dev only)
# @name login
POST {{Keycloak_HostAddress}}/realms/home-security/protocol/openid-connect/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded

grant_type=password&client_id=dev-test-client&username=dev-test-user&password=dev-test-password

###
@token = {{login.response.body.access_token}}

### Discovery entry point
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Create an organization
# @name createOrg
POST {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orgs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "acme",
  "name": "Acme Corp"
}

###
@orgId = {{createOrg.response.body.id}}

### List my organizations
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orgs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Get an organization (creator holds Owner, so addMember should be linked)
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orgs/{{orgId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List members
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orgs/{{orgId}}/members
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### List roles (system-default + custom)
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orgs/{{orgId}}/roles
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Global permission catalog
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/permissions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### A nonexistent/non-member org should 404, not 403 (leak prevention)
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/api/v1/orgs/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000099
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Health
GET {{Dzaba.HomeSecurity.Org.Service_HostAddress}}/health/ready
